                                <note>The work is divided into two parts, the first containing eleven chapters, the second containing four chapters. The table of
                                    contents (<foreign xml:lang="ar">رسالة الشبان في تأريخ دواخل الولاية من الوطان</foreign>) is inserted on <locus target="#1v"/>.
